  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your fears manifest physically, forcing your foes to relive their pain. You can spend eight link depth from the link of an allied creature as an action to cause all damage they do until the start of your next turn to be doubled. Additionally, you may move any amount of link depth from hostile links to this link and take another action.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
